    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57329" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίγκλος</span></b> , ὁ, prob.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dabchick, Podiceps
				ruficollis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Autocr.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				593b5
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίγκλου πτωχότερος</span>
			'poor as a church mouse', because it had no nest of its own, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				221
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.9
			</span></i>:—<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> has <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίγκαλος</span></b> , but
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιγκάλους</span> is unmetrical as a
			fish-name in <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.326a
			</span></i>.</div>
